1
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:46,000
The hero we need now.

2
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:26,000
The Toxic Avenger Unrated is a action, comedy, science
fiction film directed by Macon Blair.

3
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:06,000
When a downtrodden janitor, Winston Gooze, is exposed to a catastrophic toxic
accident, he’s transformed into a new kind of hero: The Toxic Avenger.

4
00:22:40,000 --> 00:22:46,000
Now, Toxie must rise from outcast to savior, taking on ruthless corporate overlords and
corrupt forces who threaten his son, his friends, and his community.

5
00:28:20,000 --> 00:28:26,000
Winston / Toxie, the Hero, played by Peter Dinklage.

6
00:34:00,000 --> 00:34:06,000
Wade, the Kid, played by Jacob Tremblay.

7
00:39:40,000 --> 00:39:46,000
J.J. Doherty, the Wild Card, played by Taylour Paige.

8
00:45:20,000 --> 00:45:26,000
Kissy Sturnevan, his Associate, played by Julia Davis.

9
00:51:00,000 --> 00:51:06,000
Thad Barkabus, the Big Boss, played by Jonny Coyne.

10
00:56:40,000 --> 00:56:46,000
Fritz Garbinger, his Creepy Brother, played by Elijah Wood.

11
01:02:20,000 --> 01:02:26,000
The Toxic Avenger Unrated is a 2023 American superhero black
comedy film written and directed by Macon Blair.

12
01:08:00,000 --> 01:08:06,000
It is the fifth installment, a reboot of The Toxic Avenger
film series, and a remake of the 1984 film.

13
01:13:40,000 --> 01:13:46,000
The film stars Peter Dinklage as the title character, alongside Jacob Tremblay,
Taylour Paige, Julia Davis, Jonny Coyne, Elijah Wood, and Kevin Bacon.

14
01:19:20,000 --> 01:19:26,000
The Toxic Avenger premiered as the opening film of Fantastic Fest on September 21, 2023, with a wider theatrical
release followed by Cineverse and Iconic Events Releasing in the United States for August 29, 2025.

15
01:25:00,000 --> 01:25:06,000
The film has received positive reviews from critics and it
grossed $3.4 million at the box office.

16
01:30:40,000 --> 01:30:46,000
The film explores themes of high school, new
jersey, police, single parent, alcohol.

17
01:36:20,000 --> 01:36:26,000
The tone is lighthearted and thought_provoking.
